         common_mistakes='Only comparing a node to its DIRECT children instead of tracking the full valid range inherited from all ancestors above it -- this is the single most common wrong answer submitted for this exact problem; using <= instead of < (a BST requires STRICT inequality, no duplicate values allowed on either side).',
